{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_sddrag_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_sddrag_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "蘆葦之心",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_sddrag_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ef44afb91235de1f4fdcf14a4025d87438e543cd8251518dc30e3be20bda22e2",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "煙塵與碎礫散溢小丘，灼灼火焰燃燒大地。\n無助的紅龍緊鎖在它的王座上。\n絲線洞穿了骨頭——這樣它就無法移動。\n源石挖開了血肉——這樣它就無法癒合。\n哭喊灌入了耳朵——這樣它就無法歇息。\n權杖釘住舌尖，王冠箍死頭腦，石球砸斷脊梁。\n它是王座上的紅龍，它是陰影的傀儡。\n反抗不被允許，懇求不被允許，逃避不被允許。\n煉獄中，活著的雕像在哭泣。\n淚水從眼眶滴下，順著絲線流入不癒的傷痕。\n受難與服從換來的，也只是沉默。\n天空下起苦澀的冰雹——\n……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wild_a"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "深池的人隨時都可能回來，我們得想辦法再弄輛車。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心，我們一定能活著逃出去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_infirmary"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她是被天災波及了嗎？源石感染和外傷都很嚴重……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，我們做好分內的事，之後就只能靠她自己了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_973_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼我們就將您的資料登記在冊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_973_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "考慮到您還是病患，就為您準備了單人宿舍，如果沒有問題的話，請在這裡簽字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "葦草坐在床上，呆呆地看著房間的門。\n羅德島的標準移動門完美履行著它被創造時賦予的使命，門外沒有一點光透進來。\n它的隔音性能當然也不應受到質疑，然而，現在正是人們開始一天生活的時段，還是有些嘈雜的人聲傳到了葦草耳朵裡。\n這正是她夢寐以求的生活。\n只要打開房門，她就能融入羅德島，過上那陽光下的日子。\n但是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚……好痛……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "源石結晶提醒著她——\n負罪感提醒著她——\n陰影提醒著她——\n她不配。\n即使心懷愧疚，她畢竟喊著“為了深池”處決過很多人。\n那些或年輕、或蒼老的靈魂時刻緊盯著她，他們所能做的唯一一件事，就是在這搖擺不定的蘆葦飄盪時狠狠刺痛她的心靈。\n這是死者們僅存的復仇手段。\n懺悔便能被寬恕，這只是無情者的便宜法則，真正的寬恕並不存在。\n畢竟逝者不會開口，也不會原諒，只會折磨。\n就像他們曾受到的折磨一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣……就好了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是我應得的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "葦草重新躺下，讓自己背對著房門，好像這樣就能無視門外的喧囂。\n那不屬於她，她沒有資格。\n即使她是如此地渴望——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "囚牢才是我的歸宿……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "然而，在這黑暗之中……\n她仍記得，天空中偶爾洞穿陰雲的光芒。\n來自一個熾熱的圓環……就像太陽那樣……\n她渴望著觸碰那光芒……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_973_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "葦草小姐，您在裡面嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請稍等……馬上來……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好，葦草小姐，我是來幫您做例行身體檢查的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士是不是會……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊——博士和您約定的應該是全面的定期身體檢查吧，現在做的只是最平常的測血壓心率，不涉及抽血和較大儀器之類的檢查。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您現在還是病患，一些數據還是需要時常監測的，博士也不一定一直有空閒。等到您的病情進入穩定狀態，我就不會來打擾您了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，如果您不願意的話，我也不會強迫您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有勞您了……請進吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那請您先躺回床上吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "燈的開關……應該是在……這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，不好意思！我這就幫您調暗點——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不用，這樣就可以了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好、好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那您平躺在床上就可以，接下來交給我就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_light"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在躺下前，葦草把自己的尾巴移到了床的另一側，這樣那燃燒著的火焰就不會影響醫療部的幹員工作。\n床上的布料都是用特殊材料製作的，因此倒也不必擔心尾巴會不經意間點燃整個房間。\n葦草本以為醫療幹員會好奇地盯著她的尾巴問這問那，但醫療幹員只是盯著自己的紀錄本和儀器，沒有要閒聊的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "於是葦草仰面躺在床上，看著天花板，而後，視線慢慢地被頂燈散發出的光所吸引。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣應該就好了……接下來是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那就是一盞平平無奇的天花板頂燈，仔細一點看，便能透過燈罩，看到裡面圓環狀的燈管。\n就像是一位薩科塔閃耀的光環……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您知道……那位救下我的薩科塔在哪裡嗎？我想和她道個謝……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您是由一位維多利亞瓦伊凡和一些去小丘郡執行任務的羅德島幹員一起送上羅德島的，他們裡面好像沒有薩科塔幹員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我記錯了嗎……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "葦草繼續看著頂燈，那位薩科塔的光芒在她記憶裡很鮮明，應該不會錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我聽說，在那次行動裡確實有精英幹員犧牲了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "精英幹員……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是一位很受尊敬的老人家，雖然她基本上不會來醫療部，但那些過來看病或體檢的狙擊幹員都會提到她幾句。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說她是個很耐心的人，說她的左輪銃非常準……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得，她好像是一位薩科塔……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她……該怎麼稱呼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Outcast……他們都這樣稱呼她……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Outcast……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "聊天的話題似乎進入了一個死角，兩人也默契地不再談論任何事物，只有醫療儀器偶爾發出的提示音還在房間中迴響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的，這樣檢查就結束了。恭喜您葦草小姐，很多指標都比上次測量時好了許多，您的病情應該很快就能穩定了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那，沒什麼其他事的話，我就先離開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要幫您把燈關上嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用，這樣就好……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我就不打擾您了，葦草小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "犧牲了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我的錯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "葦草的腦中一片空白。\n她之前從未和這位Outcast有過交集——她甚至是剛剛才知道這個代號。\n而對方為了拯救她，犧牲了自己的生命？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Outcast……Outcast……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她一遍遍唸誦著這個名字，這個為她掀開黑暗衣角的名字。\n……\n無論是出於敬意，或是尊重，抑或是好奇，她都覺得自己有責任去了解這個偉大的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "當然，做完這一切後，她就會重新回到這個房間，繼續她的自我禁錮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "生活突然就以如此鮮活的形式出現，這讓葦草不太適應。\n一些親切的問候，一些瑣碎事帶來的吵鬧，還有些打發時間的閒聊。\n她有多久沒經歷過這樣的場景了？\n葦草右手握著左手手腕，靠著走廊邊緣，盡量收起尾巴，讓自己不那麼顯眼。\n她多麼想現在就撲入這生活中，去買支鋼筆，或喝上一杯飲料。\n她不被允許。\n往日的冤魂就在她肩膀上，撕碎她對美好生活的一切期待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodescom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？您好，葦草小姐，請坐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什麼需要我幫忙的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想問一下……Outcast……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊……您找她有事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她的辦公室離這裡不遠，畢竟職務調動也就是幾個月前的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我這有份地圖，您可以看一眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大概……這樣走，轉過彎就到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不客氣，這是我應該做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）Outcast的辦公室不是已經……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）多嘴，做你的事去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）我會不知道嗎？你就不能留點念想給人家嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是是是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉……可憐的人啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "應該就是這裡了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodescom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "檔案室幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_973_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好，請問您是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請問Outcast的辦公室是這裡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "檔案室幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_973_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "檔案室幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_973_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，這裡以前是她的辦公室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "檔案室幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_973_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最近我們剛剛經過交接，準備把這間辦公室用作新的檔案整理室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "檔案室幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_973_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您是她的……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事……只是隨便看看……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "檔案室幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_973_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隨便——呃，好的，我大概瞭解了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "檔案室幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_973_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請自便吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Outcast……她還有東西留在這裡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "檔案室幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_973_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "個人物品的話應該由人事部那邊的幹員處理掉了，抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她本以為在這裡能夠找到Outcast存在過的痕跡，但除了一間空蕩蕩的辦公室，一個陌生的人，她什麼都沒找到……\n於是她開始思考，羅德島上還有什麼地方會與這位薩科塔有所關聯。\n薩科塔……銃……狙擊幹員……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能再問你一件事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "檔案室幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_973_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "射擊訓練場在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_trainingcom"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "葦草來到了訓練場，盼望著能找到關於Outcast的消息，任何消息都行，這裡一定有了解她的人。\n但在進入這座寬廣的設施後，她只感到了……恐懼。\n不幸的人被綁縛在標靶上，被蒙蔽的人舉起武器，等待著她的命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……不是……不應該是這樣的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "無論她想說什麼，無論她說了什麼。她的語言都是號令，有人扣下扳機，有人中箭身亡。\n幹員是來訓練的，於是他們重複著循環——填彈、瞄準、射擊。\n標靶是該被破壞的，於是它們也重複著循環——等待、被擊中、給出回應。\n犧牲者被綁死在了標靶上，在生命流盡前，他們會不斷控訴葦草的暴行。\n於是，這裡不再是訓練場，而是她惡行的展覽館。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還好嗎~？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……謝謝……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "訓練場管理員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "六號訓練位和五四七八這幾個位置暫時封閉維修十五分鐘，在那打靶的幹員都先下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "訓練場管理員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後，用六號位的混蛋，別想著走，給我滾到管理室來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個帶爆炸彈來訓練場打靶的人估計要挨罵了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，你好呀安德切爾~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好克洛絲，旁邊那位是你新認識的朋友嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有哦，只是剛剛遇到，應該是想來訓練場體驗一下射擊的幹員姐姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢竟她帶著這柄長槍，怎麼看都不像是狙擊幹員呢~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好，我是安德切爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我好像也忘記做介紹了——你好，我是克洛絲哦~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "葦草……這樣稱呼我就可以了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "話說，安德切爾，你們準備好之後的測試了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。有玫蘭莎帶著大家，不會有問題的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我看你之前在訓練位上用的是手銃欸~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，你看到了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（銃……薩科塔……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然還沒有銃的使用權，但作為一個拉特蘭人，怎麼會不想試試呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我之前向Outcast老師請教了手銃的使用方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是黑鋼的那種嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老師教了我很多射擊的訣竅，像是持握銃的動作對於反應速度的影響，或是怎樣才能快速拔銃射擊之類的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "演示的時候老師還特地用銃和弩都演示了一次，告訴我一些動作實際上是能夠融會貫通的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那有空的時候得教教我哦，我也想多學幾招~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，沒問題的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前和老師約定好等她回來就驗收我的學習成果，但……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（Outcast……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "使用銃射擊……是什麼感覺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感覺嗎？嗯……我也說不太清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "訓練場管理員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，把那幾個擋板和警示標記拿走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "訓練場管理員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "五個訓練位重新開放了，上去練手吧，伙計們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "試試看就知道了，葦草。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可以嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "訓練手銃是專門為新手準備的，和弓弩一樣，使用難度沒那麼大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且我們就在旁邊，不會有事的~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "握法看我的動作就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣……嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對，手指的位置……都沒問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之後舉起銃，準星對準目標，扣下扳機就可以了哦~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對準目標……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她緊緊握著銃。\n訓練銃都很輕巧，但她發現手中的銃一直在微微搖晃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用緊張的，深呼吸~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她瞄準了她的傷痕，她的怨靈，她罪惡的展品。\n扣下扳機——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打中了呢~雖然偏了一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "葦草的那一擊完全沒有打中靶心，只在靶紙的左上角留下了一個黑點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "葦草放下了銃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不再試試看嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣就夠了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "當她打出那發子彈時，銃給出了強烈的反應。\n這就是薩科塔的武器，扣下扳機便是聲明，與此同時，承擔後果。\n每一發子彈的代價，Outcast都很清楚，而她……應該沒有猶豫過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我就繼續訓練了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切爾",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等測試結束以後，我想我得去一次遺物室，和老師匯報一下成果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遺物室？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，遺物室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島的遺物室，離開我們的好老師們留下的東西都集中放在那裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們說的遺物室……在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_warehouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "遺物室入口"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "進入綜合生物處理室後，再轉過一個彎，就是進入遺物室的大門，或許是考慮到房間的特殊性，遺物室前有一條長長的廊道。\n葦草本想直接進去，但拐角處兩位幹員的談話吸引了她的注意。\n他們提到了一個名字——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（Outcast……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那兩位幹員似乎曾是Outcast的隊員。\n於是她在牆角站定，裝作是在等待某人。\n她想聽聽他們對於Outcast的看法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "平靜的幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你後悔嗎？沒有和她一起去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "平靜的幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看過報告，小丘郡發生的一切都完全超出了控制。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即便如此，她想要活著回來，應該不難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她是Outcast。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "平靜的幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……彈巢被Misery帶了回來，她最後打了六發。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "平靜的幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你覺得她會後悔嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "葦草屏住了呼吸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她從不後悔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "平靜的幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我還是要再問你一次，你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "葦草別過頭去，她幾乎可以想像到接下來的對話。\n遷怒，憎恨，她再熟悉不過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也沒什麼可後悔的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（欸？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她需要我們幫助時從不遮掩，這次既然決定一個人去，一定有她的考量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "平靜的幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從小丘郡撤離的人帶回了一個重症傷員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感染者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "平靜的幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果有什麼結局能夠令她滿意，這一定是其中一種。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "平靜的幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就別打擾Outcast休息了，她忙了那麼久，也該多睡會了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "平靜的幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "晚安，親愛的老伙計，希望你夢裡還能記得我們幾個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "平靜的幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們下次再來看你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她能得救應當是個偶然。\n但有一點卻是毋庸置疑的。\n只要她能和Outcast相遇，那她就能夠得救。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "無論處境怎麼變化，結果都是如此。\n葦草看向長廊盡頭，看向遺物室的入口。\nOutcast正在裡面等待她的到來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_warehouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "原本，這些遺物和其他無人認領的物品一起被堆放在綜合生物處理室的倉庫中。\n但所有人都知道，有些東西，不會再有人前來認領，而只是那樣放在倉庫裡，珍貴的遺物注定會受到時間的侵蝕。\n於是它們被放入了定製的儲藏格中，安置進倉庫盡頭的小房間裡。\n這裡是羅德島給那些為了事業獻出生命的幹員們準備的墓地。\n但這裡沒有鮮花，更沒有墓碑。\n每個人都壓低聲響，生怕打擾到逝者安息。\n葦草也是如此，她收斂著自己的火焰，盡量不讓火光破壞了這寂靜的氛圍。\n每個遺物格前都有一束光，葦草順著光芒確認著在此安眠的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Scout……Whitesmith……\nOutcast。\n她的遺物就在這裡。\n葦草走上前去，一旁也恰巧有人準備離去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（輕聲）博士……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "（頷首）",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在這裡，沉默是最好的交流。\n於是簡單的社交禮儀過後，兩人擦肩而過。\n也就是在這時，葦草看到了博士所悼念的那位幹員的代號——\nAce。\n或許那是屬於另一位拯救者的故事，或許某一日，有人會向她說起。\n但不是今天。\n她走到Outcast的遺物格前，微微鞠了一躬，而後觀覽著她在這片大地上的遺留。\n遺物格中有一個損壞的彈巢，旁邊有他人為Outcast所撰寫的評價——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（“她行過刀山火海也不曾有一刻向奸邪低頭，她槍口火舌焦灼好似怒陽，她頭頂光芒熾烈幾勝白晝。”）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（“此處安葬著Outcast，我們的朋友。”）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（您好，Outcast。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我是來道謝的，謝謝您給了我一個機會。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我是……葦草。我來這裡，是想要尋找答案。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我想知道救下我性命的，是怎樣一個人。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（現在我知道了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我一直心有疑慮，認為您的拯救帶有目的。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我錯了。生命在您眼中是沒有區別的。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（謝謝……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我曾經是姐姐的傀儡，做了許多令人不齒的事，我曾經以為這片大地就是這樣黑暗。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（但現在，您教導了我，告訴我大地上仍有光芒。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不是災厄的火光，而是……更溫暖、更閃耀的……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我應該成為光芒嗎？我可以嗎，就像您一樣？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "光照在Outcast的遺物格上，也照在了葦草身上，在她身後拉出一條融入環境的影子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我是個……軟弱的人，所以我反抗不了姐姐，也沒法像您一樣，豁出性命實踐自己的理想……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（但我……我會試著去做的……我可以報答您的，只有這個了……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我還需要時間……我得明白，自己應該去做什麼，才對得起您，對得起這一次生命。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（火焰總是帶來陰影……但我想試試看，讓它帶來生命和希望。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_226_weed_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（……再會，Outcast。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "葦草轉過身，從光芒下走進了黑暗中。\n離開房間的路又長又暗，把葦草整個吞沒，只剩下她尾尖的那點火焰。\n但她的火焰平穩而不屈，散發著光芒與熱量，堅定而執著地向著出口飄去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "於是乎，有生以來，遍體鱗傷的紅龍第一次發出吼聲。\n枯槁昏暗的小丘上，閃過了一絲光芒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
